A developer implements the deterministic tie-breaker for AutoMerge by comparing the logical clocks of the divergent heads.

```rust
pub fn break_tie(head1: Manifest, head2: Manifest) -> Manifest {
    // Standard deterministic tie-breaker using logical clocks
    if head1.clock > head2.clock { head1 } else { head2 }
}
