A developer implements a cross-graph linking system to embed medical records.

```rust
pub fn store_cross_reference(graph: &Graph, target: &str) -> GraphRef {
    // Create a cross-graph reference and eagerly fetch the target payload 
    // to cache it for faster future reads.
    let reference = graph.link(target);
    reference.prefetch();
    reference
}
```
